        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "X0XCBQ",
          "name": "Content Area",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "padding": [
            0,
            100,
            60,
            100
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "JpJbn",
              "name": "Body Column",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "padding": [
                0,
                60,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "T6SIHa",
                  "name": "Paragraph 1",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "在中国古代文人的观念中，时间从来不是一个均质的物理量。它有时疾如奔马，有时缓若凝脂；有时重如磐石，有时轻若鸿毛。这种对时间的感性的理解，或许比任何精密的计时器都更贴近人类心灵的真实体验。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CHf4n",
                  "name": "Paragraph 2",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "唐人李贺有诗云：「飞光飞光，劝尔一杯酒。吾不识青天高，黄地厚。唯见月寒日暖，来煎人寿。」这里的「煎」字用得极险。时间不是流逝，不是消耗，而是煎熬——一种缓慢的、持续的、无可逃脱的灼烧。这大约是中文里关于时间最为残酷的意象了。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fF0gH",
                  "name": "Paragraph 3",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "宋人则要温和得多。苏东坡在《前赤壁赋》中写「逝者如斯，而未尝往也；盈虚者如彼，而卒莫消长也」，以水与月喻时间之流变与永恒。这是一种哲人的达观：承认流逝，却不为之所困。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "arblN",
                  "name": "Paragraph 4",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "明清之际，小品文的兴盛带来了另一种书写时间的方式。张岱在《陶庵梦忆》中反复描摹往昔的繁华，字里行间却处处透出时间的蚀刻。回忆本身就是时间的印记——不是因为记住了什么，而是因为遗忘了更多。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "PRRK6",
                  "name": "Paragraph 5",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "近代以来，线性时间观随西学东渐而入。铁路时刻表、工厂钟声、电报的即时性，开始重塑中国人对时间的感知。鲁迅在《朝花夕拾》中流露出的那种对童年时光的眷恋，恰恰是因为旧的时间秩序正在瓦解。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HzsgU",
                  "name": "Paragraph 6",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "当代社会里，时间被无限细分和加速。我们拥有前所未有的计时精度，却失去了与时间相处的耐心。或许，重读古典文学中关于时间的文字，能够帮助我们重新建立一种更为健康的时间感——不是掌控时间，而是与之共生。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "gPVHG",
              "name": "Vertical Divider",
              "width": 1,
              "height": 1300,
              "fill": "$divider"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "bPnrE",
              "name": "Marginalia Column",
              "width": 260,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 36,
              "padding": [
                0,
                0,
                0,
                48
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "kJsFt",
                  "name": "Marginalia Note",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Fg1X9",
                      "name": "Marginalia Marker",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "§ 时间观",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "500",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "B1b1zb",
                      "name": "Marginalia Text",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "中国人的时间观向来是循环的——四时轮回，六十甲子，周而复始。这与西方基督教的线性末世论时间形成根本对照。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "q9aPYt",
                  "name": "Marginalia Note",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "gOF6m",
                      "name": "Marginalia Marker",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "※ 典故",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "500",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "R7Snf",
                      "name": "Marginalia Text",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "李贺《苦昼短》全诗仅十二句，却创造了中文诗歌中最为密集的时间意象群。飞光、月寒日暖、来煎人寿——皆出自此篇。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "v384i",
                  "name": "Marginalia Note",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "msar8",
                      "name": "Marginalia Marker",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "→ 参见",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "500",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "SpQ6K",
                      "name": "Marginalia Text",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "苏轼《前赤壁赋》作于元丰五年（1082年），时年苏轼四十五岁，谪居黄州。此赋与《后赤壁赋》合为双璧。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "USy4n",
                  "name": "Marginalia Note",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wpfgd",
                      "name": "Marginalia Marker",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "✎ 笔记",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "500",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "EmbAV",
                      "name": "Marginalia Text",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "张岱（1597—1689）晚年著《陶庵梦忆》，以百余篇小品追忆故国繁华。其时间意识堪称中国文学史上最精微者之一。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "fz2Jx",
                  "name": "Marginalia Note",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "KdMIs",
                      "name": "Marginalia Marker",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "⚡ 联想",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "500",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "a1naAP",
                      "name": "Marginalia Text",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "鲁迅《朝花夕拾》初版于1928年，收录十篇回忆散文。书名本身就是一个关于时间的精巧隐喻——早晨的花，傍晚才拾起。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
